.TH PSALMODY 1
.SH NAME
psalmody \- note-list music editor
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/psalmody
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I Psalmody
is a note-list music editor.
It runs under
.IR wm (1).
.PP
Type A–G notes, octave digits, and w/h/q/e/s durations into a Tk list; space plays the score.
.PP
The controls are:
.TF space
.TP
.B 0-9
Set octave
.TP
.B A-G
Append note
.TP
.B w / h / q / e / s
Set duration
.TP
.B space / Play
Play score
.TP
.B Save / Load / Clear buttons
File and list ops
.TP
.B Esc / q
Quit
.PD
.SH FILES
.TP
.B /tmp/temple-song.txt
Data file.
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/temple/psalmody.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR temple (1),
.IR tone (2),
.IR wm (1)
